  'Your Nilgiris Trip, Booked by Locals',
  'OotyMade Tourism | Stays, Travel & Experiences in The Nilgiris',
  'Plan your Nilgiris trip with local experts. Stays, taxis, and guided experiences across Ooty, Coonoor & Kotagiri, from the team behind OotyMade.com.',
  'Uber and Ola don''t work in Ooty. An E-Pass is mandatory for entry. A "10 km" drive can take 15 minutes or 90 depending on the ghat road. Most guides tell you what to see in the Nilgiris — almost none tell you how to actually get there, stay somewhere reliable, and not lose a day figuring out logistics on the ground. OotyMade Tourism handles that part. Stay, travel, and guided experiences across Ooty, Coonoor and Kotagiri — planned and arranged by the team behind OotyMade.com.',
  'Stay — matched to your dates, verified by our team before we recommend it. Travel — pre-arranged drivers, no airport-arrival taxi negotiation. Experiences — timed and guided so you don''t waste the good hours. Packages — one plan, one point of contact, instead of five separate bookings. A long-time Ooty resident once put it plainly: most tourist spots feel overrated unless someone local is actually showing you around. That''s the entire reason OotyMade Tourism exists.',
